# SCIENTIFIC_LOCK (immutable boundaries)
- Never touch feng/terminal, Phase 9, FENG_PHASE9_UNLOCK, feng-freeze tag, sealed outcomes. Do not mutate feng/.
- 7-27/7-28 = exon-7 gels; 7-7/7-9 = exon-3. Lab outcome workbook SMN2_Exon7_7_27+28_Complete_Data.xlsx excluded from fitting/selection/joins. July gels NOT prospective.
- No fabricated negatives; no AUPRC/FDR/accuracy without verified negatives (else PU mode). Holgersen S4 = responder-only.
- Modified ASO != RNA thermodynamics; dG/occupancy != potency. N-mask Pangolin = sequence_ablation_proxy.
- Every result labelled observed|derived|proxy|model_assumption|unlabeled|not_available.
- No /orcd/scratch|pool traversal; no heavy compute on login node; no push; no paid credits.
## Update 2026-11-15 (user directive)
- SMN2_Exon3_Complete_Data.xlsx (July 7/9, exon-3 microwalk) may be parsed for a SEPARATE exploratory positional-splicing analysis only. Never exon-7 validation; never used to train/tune/select models; no prospective claim.
- SMN2_Exon7_7_27+28_Complete_Data.xlsx stays excluded from all fitting/joins; any analysis of it only by explicit later user instruction.
- Wet-lab files live in conference/model_v2/data/wetlab/ (git-ignored via .gitignore 'data'); originals never modified; SHA-256 recorded in ops/WETLAB_MANIFEST.json.

