The edge-case tests found two fixes to make: terminal exon boundaries need to be excluded from donor/acceptor candidates, and nonfinite J3 scores need explicit failure status. evaluation_core also requires grouping metadata for supervised metrics; I’ll use its unlabeled-mode refusal without inventing groups.
apply patch
